    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... everyone says that. it feels like just a script. i'm not looking for a hotline, i'm just saying how it actually feels. it doesn't feel like a \"crisis\" that can be fixed with a phone call. it feels like a fact. like i've just reached the end of my usefulness or something. it's just heavy, you know? it feels like the truth.",
